+# Switch 2 (kaiHEN)
+
+Homebrew build for Nintendo Switch 2 running kaiHEN, with the
+[ounce-devkit](https://github.com/ouncebrew/ounce-devkit): libounce (libnx for
+Switch 2) and OunceVK (Vulkan, and EGL/OpenGL ES through Zink).
+
+## Build
+
+```sh
+source $DEVKITPRO/switch2vars.sh
+aarch64-none-elf-cmake -S . -B build-switch2 -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DBUILD_TESTING=OFF
+cmake --build build-switch2      # -> build-switch2/ctr-native.nro
+```
+
+The toolchain sets `NINTENDO_SWITCH2`, which turns on `CTR_NATIVE_SWITCH2`,
+the GLES 3 renderer and `-fsigned-char` (the PS1 code assumes a signed char,
+which AArch64 ELF does not give by default).
+
+## Platform layer
+
+SDL3 has no Switch platform. `sdl3_switch2.c` implements the SDL3 calls this
+tree makes, compiled against SDL3's own headers (`externals/SDL/include`) so
+types, enums and scancodes are exact and the callers are unchanged:
+
+| SDL area | Switch 2 |
+| --- | --- |
+| window, GL context, swap | EGL on `nwindowGetDefault()`, 1920x1080 in both modes |
+| GL loader | `eglGetProcAddress` |
+| gamepads | libnx `pad`, players 1-4 (player 1 includes handheld); SOUTH = B |
+| rumble | `hidSendVibrationValues` |
+| audio stream | audren voice at the stream's rate (44.1 kHz), 4 x 1024-frame buffers, mixing thread on core 2 |
+| events | `appletMainLoop` (quit), pad connect/disconnect, HOME/sleep as background/foreground |
+| time | `armGetSystemTick` |
+| paths | base = directory of the NRO from argv (default `sdmc:/switch/ctr-native/`) |
+
+Keyboard, mouse, SDL surfaces and virtual joysticks are not provided.
+
+`switch2_main.c` owns `main()`: it redirects stdout/stderr to `stdout.log` and
+`stderr.log` next to the NRO, and runs the game (`CtrNative_Main`) on an
+8 MiB stack. Missing game data shows a text screen instead of exiting.
+
+## SD card
+
+```
+sdmc:/switch/ctr-native/
+  ctr-native.nro
+  ctr-native.ini        written with defaults on first start
+  assets/BIGFILE.BIG, assets/SOUNDS/KART.HWL, assets/XA/...   (or assets/ctr-u.bin)
+```
+
+`ctr-native.ini`: `widescreen`, `internal_scale` (1-4), `bilinear`, `voices`
+(ENG, SPN, ...), `unlock_all`, `capture_swaps` (diagnostic BMP captures).
+
+`CTR_SWITCH2_CTR_WEB_ASSETS` (default ON) is for data converted from the PAL
+disc by ctr-web: PAL VRAM layout (`CTR_SWAPCHAIN_Y=0xEC`), no XA music and no
+`TEST.STR`. Turn it OFF for an NTSC-U `ctr-u.bin`. `CTR_SWITCH2_SKIP_INTRO`
+(default ON) boots into the main menu.
